<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net45;net461;netstandard2.0;netstandard2.1</TargetFrameworks>
    <AssemblyTitle>欧姆龙PLC通信协议库</AssemblyTitle>
    <Description>纯.NET实现的欧姆龙PLC通信协议库，完整支持FINS/TCP、FINS/UDP、HostLink三种协议，提供同步+异步完整API，适用于工业自动化、数据采集、设备监控等场景</Description>
    <Company>新生命开发团队</Company>
    <Copyright>©2002-2026 新生命开发团队</Copyright>
    <VersionPrefix>1.1</VersionPrefix>
    <VersionSuffix>$([System.DateTime]::Now.ToString(`yyyy.MMdd`))</VersionSuffix>
    <Version>$(VersionPrefix).$(VersionSuffix)</Version>
    <FileVersion>$(Version)</FileVersion>
    <AssemblyVersion>$(VersionPrefix).*</AssemblyVersion>
    <Deterministic>false</Deterministic>
    <OutputPath>..\Bin</OutputPath>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <SignAssembly>True</SignAssembly>
    <AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>..\Doc\newlife.snk</AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>$(AssemblyName)</PackageId>
    <Authors>$(Company)</Authors>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://newlifex.com/iot</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>leaf.png</PackageIcon>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NewLifeX/NewLife.Omron</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>物联网;IoT;边缘计算;Edge;新生命团队;NewLife;PLC;欧姆龙;OMRON;FINS;FinsClient;FinsUdp;HostLink;工业自动化;数据采集;设备监控;SCADA;通信协议;自动重连;异步;BatchRead;FinsServer;$(AssemblyName)</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v1.1.2026.1024
依赖升级：NewLife.IoT 升级至 3.2.2026.1024；SourceLink 升级至 10.0.402；测试框架升级至 Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk 18.11.0、xunit.runner.visualstudio 4.0.1、coverlet.collector 10.1.0
发布流程：对齐 NewLife.Core，推送 v 标签时同时发布 GitHub Packages 与 NuGet.org，并创建 GitHub Release
完整测试：555 个单元测试全部通过，覆盖 FINS/TCP、FINS/UDP、HostLink 三种协议与 27 种命令
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <AllowedOutputExtensionsInPackageBuildOutputFolder>$(AllowedOutputExtensionsInPackageBuildOutputFolder);.pdb</AllowedOutputExtensionsInPackageBuildOutputFolder>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="10.0.402">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="NewLife.IoT" Version="3.2.2026.1024" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="..\Doc\leaf.png" Link="leaf.png" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
